Licence for Unison.sf3
======================

`Unison.sf3` in this directory is a SoundFont bank. It is NOT covered by the
AGPL-3.0-or-later licence that applies to the Rust source code of this crate
and the rest of the `rameau` workspace.

    Bank:    Unison
    Licence: CC0-1.0 (Creative Commons Zero v1.0 Universal)
    Source:  https://rkhive.com/new/new_banks/unison.zip

The bank was converted from the original `Unison.SF2` to Ogg/Vorbis-compressed
`.sf3` at quality 0.5 using this workspace's `rameau_soundfont_convert` crate.
The conversion is lossy for sample audio; no other content was altered.


